gin after her father, Riku Yuuki dies, and hands him something that Yuuki apparently left for him. Though he is hesitant, Suigin accepts the item, which happens to be a specialized console to play the new game “Grave Buster.” On the console, Riku Yuuki left Suigin a message and one billion in inheritance and tells him to protect Riku Rei.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/egPST2YaY70XpU91O17GVUF0whe.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Riku Rei summons Suigin after her father, Riku Yuuki dies, and hands him something that Yuuki apparently left for him. Though he is hesitant, Suigin accepts the item, which happens to be a specialized console to play the new game “Grave Buster.” On the console, Riku Yuuki left Suigin a message and one billion in inheritance and tells him to protect Riku Rei.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/egPST2YaY70XpU91O17GVUF0whe.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11840","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21662","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"32936","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"71005","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"324710","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"30280","synopsis":"Riku Rei is taken by some debt collectors, and Suigin follows them. However, Riku Rei’s captors immediately get away by car. Suigin somehow manages to catch up on a bike, but she is then taken away by a mysterious man who magically disappears.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5txjFu2672aENmC9vrjcTXOVE82.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"Riku Rei is taken by some debt collectors, and Suigin follows them. However, Riku Rei’s captors immediately get away by car. Suigin somehow manages to catch u